    ["<Yellow>Full Moon</>: Strengthens your own and your teammates' combat skills, increasing their level by <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=1?+1}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=2?+2}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=3?+3}</>, which can stack; \n<Yellow>Gate of Summoning</>: Strengthens the marionette, increasing the damage and healing effects of Marionette Skills by <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=1?50%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=2?60%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=3?70%}</>. When a Marionette Skill is on Cooldown, using Basic Attacks and combat skills on a target has a chance to force the marionette to be summoned, casting one Marionette Skill. Within a single Cooldown cycle of a Marionette Skill, the forced summon effect can trigger at most <Yellow>1</> time."] = "<Yellow>Full Moon</>: Strengthens your own and your teammates' Боевой навыкs, increasing their level by <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=1?+1}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=2?+2}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=3?+3}</>, which can stack; \n<Yellow>Gate of Summoning</>: Strengthens the Марионетка, increasing the damage and healing effects of Марионетка Skills by <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=1?50%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=2?60%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=3?70%}</>. When a Марионетка Skill is on Перезарядка, using Базовая атакаs and Боевой навыкs on a target has a chance to force the Марионетка to be summoned, casting one Марионетка Skill. Within a single Перезарядка cycle of a Марионетка Skill, the forced summon effect can trigger at most <Yellow>1</> time.",
